Spec: Bounded duplex business framing

Purpose:
  Carry independent TCP directions over a private stream without losing partial IO, backpressure or half-close.

Owns:
  ./BusinessStream.cs

Must:
  Bound each data frame and retained read buffer to `16384` bytes.
  Distinguish clean directional FIN from transport loss; complete writes without closing the read direction.
  Acknowledge received FIN and allow bounded final acknowledgement drain before closing a buffered transport.
  Serialize each direction without an unbounded request queue and never replay payload.
  Expose fixed close errors without reflecting peer data.
